      evolution-provider.ts ............... adapter Evolution API (nao-oficial)
      evolution-admin.ts .................. admin ops Evolution
      meta-provider.ts .................... adapter Meta Cloud API (oficial)
      instagram-provider.ts ............... adapter Instagram Messenger API (stub)
      message-processing.service.ts ....... processamento de mensagens inbound
    whatsapp-connections/
      whatsapp-connections.controller.ts .. endpoints: pair, create-meta, create-instagram, delete
      whatsapp-connections.service.ts ...... logica de negocio de conexoes
  prisma/
    schema.prisma ......................... enum WhatsAppProvider { EVOLUTION META INSTAGRAM }
```

